          "text": " Koinakis kanuka atiakunio naka etogo lo loka Edeke, imoŋin lutoba akwatat, imerekekin akwat aarei, imerekekin ludidik akwat aoŋon; ido ikorwa itomon ka luarei araut ainakinet naka adiakaret naka Isirael kere, kwape ajaar etiai loka atekerin nuka Isirael. ",
